<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Sekaraia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sekaraia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sekaraia</para>
  <para style="mt">Sekaraia</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Ana na yegl diga, Ene topo naramnedi pribi, nario! Te, ta manan, kodio! di, yegl diga. Na yegl digo, ye mige silva 30-pela kere, topo narikwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Topo yegl nariko, Yawe na yegl di narukwa, Ye na kide kanigwa pre mige kebra yegl keme na pre tenamnedi prime dugwa. Ana mige silva 30-pela i, pia si, yagl ta makan koglwa sin bekugwa i moglmara edo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, na i pi Yawe yugumo pidre, pia si yagl ta makan koglwa sin bekugwa i moglmara ediga.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>